00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
He loves
that bit of information.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:23.810 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He loves to tell people

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.146
that the reason the pizza
and the bagels are good

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.013 size:84% position:42% line:92%
is 'cause of the water.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:30.183
-So, this is something that just
